    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/d43cbb301e89972ca664fb18e537991c.poster.avif?t=1753990456\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/d43cbb301e89972ca664fb18e537991c.webm?t=1753990456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SeedGod</strong> is a roguelike deck builder inspired by the 1990 game Minesweeper. In this game, you must strategically plant crops in a field infested with bugs, and not planting is not an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where is the bug?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/b187d41fea95f00a6b5d666db0fa628e.poster.avif?t=1753990456\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/b187d41fea95f00a6b5d666db0fa628e.webm?t=1753990456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the numbers to guide you on where to plant and where not to plant your crops. If there\u2019s a 1, I wouldn\u2019t plant around it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The bugs can be aggressive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/1a1b240c7fa00de30bfcb03d6997a294.avif?t=1753990456\" data-has-big width=800 height=217 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only are they aggressive when you accidentally touch them, but they are also difficult to catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique plants and tools.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/23558ab0d35f973c9a73866a0672860a.poster.avif?t=1753990456\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/23558ab0d35f973c9a73866a0672860a.webm?t=1753990456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some players hoard the best plants and tools, but if you have money, you can surely get them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The smell of newness reaches here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/39437d8534ce843df154d0a3f988297d.poster.avif?t=1753990456\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/39437d8534ce843df154d0a3f988297d.webm?t=1753990456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the merchant will be willing to sell you packages that can be very interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gardener: Did you know that plants produce seeds?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/8867575e8273a3b402ff6708cdd50347.poster.avif?t=1753990456\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/8867575e8273a3b402ff6708cdd50347.webm?t=1753990456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you plant in the garden, the chance of one of your plants producing a seed increases with each plant sown. It might give you an epic seed, or it might not.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/d43cbb301e89972ca664fb18e537991c.poster.avif?t=1753990456\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/d43cbb301e89972ca664fb18e537991c.webm?t=1753990456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SeedGod</strong> is a roguelike deck builder inspired by the 1990 game Minesweeper. In this game, you must strategically plant crops in a field infested with bugs, and not planting is not an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where is the bug?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/b187d41fea95f00a6b5d666db0fa628e.poster.avif?t=1753990456\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/b187d41fea95f00a6b5d666db0fa628e.webm?t=1753990456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the numbers to guide you on where to plant and where not to plant your crops. If there\u2019s a 1, I wouldn\u2019t plant around it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The bugs can be aggressive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/1a1b240c7fa00de30bfcb03d6997a294.avif?t=1753990456\" data-has-big width=800 height=217 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only are they aggressive when you accidentally touch them, but they are also difficult to catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique plants and tools.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/23558ab0d35f973c9a73866a0672860a.poster.avif?t=1753990456\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/23558ab0d35f973c9a73866a0672860a.webm?t=1753990456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some players hoard the best plants and tools, but if you have money, you can surely get them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The smell of newness reaches here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/39437d8534ce843df154d0a3f988297d.poster.avif?t=1753990456\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/39437d8534ce843df154d0a3f988297d.webm?t=1753990456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the merchant will be willing to sell you packages that can be very interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gardener: Did you know that plants produce seeds?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/8867575e8273a3b402ff6708cdd50347.poster.avif?t=1753990456\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/8867575e8273a3b402ff6708cdd50347.webm?t=1753990456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you plant in the garden, the chance of one of your plants producing a seed increases with each plant sown. It might give you an epic seed, or it might not.</p>",
    "short_description": "In SeedGod, your mission is to strategically plant in a field full of bugs. Choose the best positions, and you can discover unique plants, capture bugs, find tools, and access areas that will challenge your survival tactics.",
